        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 26 at 2:59AM AKDT until September 26 at 6:00PM AKDT by NWS Juneau AK</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Southeast winds 25 to 35 kt with gusts up to 40 kt and
seas 9 to 14 ft.

* WHERE...Cape Decision to Cape Edgecumbe from 15 to 80 NM and
Icy Cape to Cape Suckling from 15 to 80 NM.

* WHEN...Until 6 PM AKDT this evening.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
